Feature: Signing in

  Background:
    Given I Visit "/"

  Scenario: The right password
    When I Fill the Field "Email" with "will@example.com"
    And I Fill the Field "Password" with "hunter2"
    And I Click the Button "Sign in"
    Then I should be At "/list.html"
    And I should See the Heading "Welcome back"

  Scenario: The wrong password
    When I Fill in the form:
      | Email    | will@example.com |
      | Password | letmein          |
    And I Click the Button "Sign in"
    Then I should See "Wrong email or password"
    And I should Not be At "/list.html"

  Scenario Outline: Both fields are needed
    When I Fill the Field "<filled>" with "something"
    And I Click the Button "Sign in"
    Then the Field "<missing>" should be Focused

    Examples:
      | filled   | missing  |
      | Email    | Password |
      | Password | Email    |
